  biomeName: Tier 22 North Reserve
  minDepthMeters: 9800
  maxDepthMeters: 10325
  shortDescription: Reserved biome slot for Tier 22 / North. The 108-biome matrix
    expects a bespoke authored identity here; final lore and geology are pending
    expansion from the master vision.
  isPlaceholder: 1
  visitPurpose: Late-game pressure biome. Come here only for major progress, rare
    extraction, and to follow strong natural shapes and search obvious pockets.
  commonRewardHook: Even routine value here comes from Tungsten Chunk and Rare Earth
    Dust.
  rareRewardHook: 'The reason to risk the trip is: Lithium Crystal and Power Coupler.'
  landmarkIdentity: Tier 22 North Reserve reads through spires, steps, and big natural
    crowns. Landmarks should feel singular and intimidating.
  safePocketIdentity: Safe pockets are rare and temporary. Retreat routes matter
    more than comfort.
  riskSummary: 'Main failure mode: bad drops and exposed lines, depth stress, and
    expensive hesitation. Creature pressure stays high.'
  extractionFocus: 'Fissure-edge scavenging, hard geometry, and exposed recovery
    points. Deep tier: favor stone pockets and hard-form nodes, extract only what
    justifies the risk, and leave cleanly.'
  landmarkGuidance: Dominant landmark is fracture mouth or gate-like break. This
    slot should read through one violent split in the world surface; use vertical
    forms to keep heading.
